<task id="071" project="spaarkeai-compose-r8">
  <metadata>
    <title>FR-D01 — Decompose ComposeDocxProjectionBuilder.cs (3,085 lines) below 2,000 and DELETE its god-class waiver</title>
    <phase>7 Track D — God-Class Removal</phase>
    <gate>blocked-on-040</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Restructures the projector — the only coordinate system in the architecture. Every anchor and every merge comparison depends on it.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Capability-matched: the projection is invariant (3) — the ONLY coordinate system. A decomposition that changes projection output by even one block boundary silently invalidates anchors, the merge's unchanged-detection, and the gate's measurements at once. Byte-level output equivalence across a 3,000-line restructure is the property to preserve, and it is not what a passing test suite proves.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>xhigh</effort>
